flowchart LR
  %% how typing in a room reaches the file
  peer1[Browser A] -->|yjs update| room[Room]
  peer2[Browser B] -->|yjs update| room
  agent[Agent presence] -.-> room
  room --> live[live_text]
  live --> merge[merge with the file on disk]
  merge -->|clean| save[Engine write]
  merge -->|conflict| keep[Keep both, report]
  save --> file[/Engram file/]
  file --> sync[Sync]
